DESIGN AUDIT IMPLEMENTATION SPRINT
====================================
Source: Professional design audit of homepage (2026-03-25)
Goal: Close gaps between current state and professional design standard.
Sequence: Foundation tokens → Section layout → Card contract → Visual rhythm → Interactivity → Accessibility

Each scope contract is layered: Structure → Layout → Style → Interactivity (where applicable).
Each scope contract has: Deliverable State, In Scope, Out of Scope, Forbidden.


================================================================================
PHASE 1 — FOUNDATION TOKENS (tailwind.config.ts)
================================================================================
Upstream changes that all subsequent phases depend on.
NO visual change to any component yet. Only config-level additions.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

